%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef7c34a5b6b91b74bbd4d9f8df67b47c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 2105433060097654826
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 68879341088931840
    m_Localized: <i>There seems to be a strange traffic jam in the main plaza...<br><br>Glarexus
      is sitting right at its center, causing townsfolk to constantly bump into him
      and giving an irritated side-eye to everyone disturbing his meditation.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341122486272
    m_Localized: Hey... Could find a different meditation spot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341122486273
    m_Localized: <i>He gives you an angry glare, then returns to his meditation.
      You notice that he's sitting on a large stone mosaic depicting the sun surrounded
      by the two moons.<br><br>Is he praying, worried about the upcoming Eclipse?</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341122486274
    m_Localized: Don't worry, friend, we'll stop the Eclipse. Though your prayers
      certainly will help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680576
    m_Localized: <i>As you reassure him you see his tense muscles relax.<br><br>He
      moves a bit from his spot so that he doesn't block the traffic anymore and
      returns to his prayers.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680577
    m_Localized: Thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680578
    m_Localized: <i>You see Golomo standing next to a big boulder.<br><br>He's gesticulating
      wildly, eyes locked on the rock's rough surface...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680579
    m_Localized: Are they... talking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680580
    m_Localized: "<i>Not only are they talking \u2014 you're almost certain they're
      <font=\"Rounded-Black SDF\">flirting!</font><br><br>Well, Golomos are known
      for their social nature and less-than-stellar eyesight...</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680581
    m_Localized: May speak with the <i>lady</i> for a second?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680582
    m_Localized: <i>You take the rock and use all your artistic ability to bring
      'Ms. Golomo' to life.<br><br>He's absolutely smitten when he sees his beautiful
      bride!</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680583
    m_Localized: All the best to the young couple!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680584
    m_Localized: <i>Out of the corner of your eye you notice Iceling abashedly trailing
      behind you, clearly building up the courage to come and ask you something.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680585
    m_Localized: What is it, buddy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680586
    m_Localized: "<i>He shyly nods to a chunky block of ice.<br>Inside is a leather
      ball \u2014 one of his favorite toys.<br><br>The poor thing must have frozen
      it by accident.</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680587
    m_Localized: I know just what to do!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680588
    m_Localized: <i>You take the frozen ball to the Brewing Cauldron and hold it
      over the fire in the kitchen.<br><br>Soon, the ball is released from its icy
      prison. Iceling is overwhelmed with joy!</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 68879341126680589
    m_Localized: Have fun! But be careful next time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69947439804055552
    m_Localized: Iceling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69947439816638464
    m_Localized: Golomo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69947439816638465
    m_Localized: Glarexus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69984989718061056
    m_Localized: The Eclipse is upon us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69984989747421184
    m_Localized: Brace yourself, Tamer. It's time to face your deepest fears...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 69984989747421185
    m_Localized: I'm not afraid. Let's put an end to this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132052172800
    m_Localized: Eftus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950016
    m_Localized: Prowler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950017
    m_Localized: Frogmar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950018
    m_Localized: Fale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950019
    m_Localized: Bolb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950020
    m_Localized: <i>Eftus is on the verge of tears! You have never seen him in such
      a state before.<br><br>In his hands rests a broken fishing rod.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950021
    m_Localized: Oh no! What happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950022
    m_Localized: <i>He points in the direction of a Pinequeak in the training area.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950023
    m_Localized: "Oh, those nasty troublemakers! Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m gonna
      get you a brand new rod!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950024
    m_Localized: "<i>You remember you should still have your childhood fishing rod
      somewhere in your tent. It\u2019s not anything special, but it was designed
      to fish under ice. It's therefore smaller and should be perfect for Eftus\u2019s
      little hands!</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950025
    m_Localized: There - hope you like it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950026
    m_Localized: <i>Eftus's eyes light up with excitement.<br><br>The second he puts
      his hands on the rod, he stops paying any attention to you.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950027
    m_Localized: Well - have fun I guess!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950028
    m_Localized: "<i>Prowler is staring at you with her giant pleading eyes. It\u2019s
      hypnotizing...</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950029
    m_Localized: Oh no...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950030
    m_Localized: <i>You are drawn into those great bottomless pits of cuteness.<br><br>Suddenly,
      you feel an overwhelming urge to give her something... shiny.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950031
    m_Localized: Must... Give... Shiny...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950032
    m_Localized: <i>As soon as you hand her a shiny trinket the hypnotizing spell
      breaks and she scurries off with her prize.<br><br>You follow her to reveal
      a HUGE stash of shiny treasure.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950033
    m_Localized: So here's where all my money has been disappearing to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950034
    m_Localized: <i>Frogmars usually tend to the furnaces around the village and
      keep them lit with their fiery breath, but something seems wrong with this
      one.<br><br>The embers are dying and the poor Frogmar seems to struggle to
      light them back up...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950035
    m_Localized: Are you alright?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950036
    m_Localized: <i>The creature doesn't respond. He tries huffing and puffing at
      the coals again and again, but only seems to let out a strained wheeze...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950037
    m_Localized: I think I know what might be the problem here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950038
    m_Localized: <i>You toss Frogmar a few pieces of coal and he chomps down on them
      eagerly.<br><br>When his belly's full, he takes a step back and, with a deep
      inhale, blows a powerful blast of fire into the furnace. The flames are reignited
      and going strong again!</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950039
    m_Localized: Always eat before work, buddy! Breakfast is the most important meal
      of the day!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950040
    m_Localized: <i>As you walk along the pier a sudden splash of water hits your
      face. You turn to see Fale sticking his head out of the water waiting for your
      reaction.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950041
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s how you want to play, huh?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950042
    m_Localized: <i>You can see Fale getting visibly excited. Finally, someone who
      wants to play!</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950043
    m_Localized: Let's make waves! Splash him back with all you've got
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950044
    m_Localized: <i>You splash Fale with water and he lets out a joyful shriek. Soon,
      you're both caught up in a playful water fight, splashing each other until
      the whole pier is soaking wet. By the end, both of you are exhausted but grinning
      from ear to ear.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950045
    m_Localized: Thanks buddy, that was fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950046
    m_Localized: <i>You feel the ground quake as you approach the towering figure
      in the center of the square. You see Bolb jumping up and down with a pair of
      maracas, clearly lacking the coordination for whatever it is he's trying to
      do.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950047
    m_Localized: You wanna dance, big boy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950048
    m_Localized: <i>His head snaps towards you and before you know it the maracas
      have been pushed into your hands, with Bolb's giant head looking at you in
      eager anticipation...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950049
    m_Localized: You want me to play some music for you? Alrighty!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950050
    m_Localized: "<i>You shake the maracas as Bolb starts showing off his iconic
      dance moves. Who knew the chill guy had so much energy! Let\u2019s just hope
      the mosaic floor survives this...</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 77944132068950051
    m_Localized: Shake Shake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312693272576
    m_Localized: May I have your attention, Tamer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855488
    m_Localized: What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855489
    m_Localized: "Your commitment to protecting our village is unmatched, yet The
      Dragon Guardian will not save us from the Eclipse\u2019s implications!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855490
    m_Localized: Elder, what is the Eclipse exactly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855491
    m_Localized: You see, a long time ago we shared the world with creatures called
      Fey and we lived in harmony. Their proficiency in the magical arts was unparalleled.
      But one day... We are not sure how and why - they led to opening a breach to
      another world. It was far from friendly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855492
    m_Localized: With a great sacrifice of Dragon Guardians, the passage was sealed,
      but something remained. The moon of the Shadow Realm, as we call it, has lingered
      in our sky ever since.<br>Every 1000 years, when two of the moons eclipse our
      sun, the portal to the Shadow Realm opens again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855493
    m_Localized: But this time, Dragon Guardians are no more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855494
    m_Localized: I need to ask... to beg you for one last sacrifice for our village
      and the rest of the world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855495
    m_Localized: Defeat the creature guarding the portal and once you enter the Shadow
      Realm, locate whatever is sending those monsters into our world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 80485312705855496
    m_Localized: "You made it thus far, giving us hope that you\u2019ll be able to
      stop the Eclipse - you and your intrepid mystlings."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770012102656
    m_Localized: <i>A piercing shriek fills the air. Eardrums ache, glass shatters,
      and at the center of this cacophony sits a small Pinequeak... crying.<br><br>You
      try shouting to it over the noise.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879872
    m_Localized: "WHAT\u2019S WRONG, LITTLE ONE?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879873
    m_Localized: <i>Little Pinequeak snaps its head towards you at the speed of light,
      the cries stopping instantly.<br><br>As it looks straight into your eyes, its
      expression suddenly shifts...</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879874
    m_Localized: Uh-oh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879875
    m_Localized: <i>With a mischievous grin, it hurls a dung bomb right at your face
      and starts laughing maniacally.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879876
    m_Localized: You got me this time, you little devil!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
  - m_Id: 81528770028879877
    m_Localized: Pinequeak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654826
